  "description": "The USGS Watershed Boundary Dataset (WBD) is a nationally consistent geospatial dataset delineating hierarchical hydrologic unit boundaries across the United States and its territories. Published by the U.S. Geological Survey's National Geospatial Technical Operations Center, it defines watershed boundaries at multiple scales (HUC-2 through HUC-12) for use in water resource management, hydrologic modeling, and land stewardship.",
